# Omni long-form playbook (locked 2026-08-16)

**Reference:** Europa v02 · Last Star v11 · BH v09 · AW v05 · Fermi v20 (`*_OPEN_END_UPLOAD.mp4`).
Europa v01 brand-intro + baked like/subscribe outro is **retired**. Build every future long in this format. Iterate when QA teaches something new — do not silently regress.

## Pipeline (after Growth System gate)

1. **~1-minute parts** — write → script QA → Ben Orbit Narrator VO → Omni Flash plates for that part only → picture QA → **stop and check with Ben** → only then next part.
2. Never gen the full episode in one pass. Regen only failed minutes/plates.
3. **~8–10 unique ~8s Omni plates per VO minute**, of which **≥2 pure-scenery (no Orbit)** — they are the native source of Shorts covers. No freeze-pad, no scenery loop (`orbit-cutscene-no-reuse` + `orbit-omni-section-qa`).
4. Assemble with paired **xfade + acrossfade**; env-gate water SFX; single Orbit / single face / travel-facing / one bottom glow.
5. After all parts lock: **picture-first open** (strange picture 3s · Orbit ~8s) · mid-film chapter cards · soft-join parts · **10s last-picture hold** for Studio end screens → `09_Final-Export/*_broadcast_v0N.mp4`. No brand sting first. No baked like/subscribe VO/graphic.
6. Then **4–8 punch Shorts** (~22–28s) from locked part roughs (`orbit-shorts-punch-first`). Zero `/go/` on Shorts. Covers: scene-first per `orbit-title-thumb-formula.mdc` — scored frame pick (never a fixed % grab), parent-film frame if the Short is Orbit-dominated, uploaded via **Studio desktop** (API cannot set Shorts covers).

## Picture / character / affiliate bar

- VO-literal journey; one VO idea → one literal image; when VO and picture disagree, picture is wrong. Orbit *in* the scene, not a sticker. **Mute test:** picture tells the story; not pretty Orbit + distant-star wallpaper under clever VO (Neutron Star Part 02, 17 Aug 2026). At most one Orbit+distant-remnant hang per minute.
- Premium CGI 3D polish; cream eyes + pupils; env honesty (no bubbles in vacuum).
- One face only — if Orbit turns, the back is solid orange. No formula corner-approach plates.
- Clipper / craft: vacuum/orbital only unless the beat is explicitly under-ice without craft.
- One named product late (after the wonder line) only if it belongs in *this* cut. `/go/{slug}` in the long description only.
- Length **NOW 7–9 min** (Last Star / Europa). Expand to 15–20–30 only later with impressions + hold past ~5 min. Recut = new YouTube id; leave old live until new is public, then unpublish.

